  "briefing": [
    "Outpost Ridgeback watches the most peaceful stretch of the northern frontier. For thirty-two years the ceasefire with the Varn Directorate has held, and the soldiers posted here joke that the biggest threat is boredom.",
    "This morning, Private Tomas Halden's squad has one job: the dawn patrol of the north fence.",
    "Nobody at Ridgeback knows that, forty kilometres north, Directorate armour has been moving all night."
